# Every change here is reviewed by the maintainer.
#
# This firmware ships as a signed binary flashed onto customer modules, and its
# wire protocol has a second half in alp-sdk -- so there is no file in this tree
# where an unreviewed change is low-consequence.
* @alpCaner

# Called out separately because a mistake in these is the expensive kind:
# a wrong version pairing silently discards a flash, and a prebuilt is the
# artifact people actually write to a part.
/prebuilt/                @alpCaner
/firmware-version.txt     @alpCaner
/protocol-version.txt     @alpCaner
/.github/workflows/       @alpCaner
